      <prov:hadRole rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/swo_prov#GeneratorRole"/>
    </prov:Association>
  </prov:qualifiedAssociation>
  <vaem:rationale>The ontology models all supplied classes, properties, and individuals to answer each atomic competency question. Classes are declared exactly as named, with subclass relations for software types. Object and datatype properties connect domains to ranges per the relation shape rule, with multiple domain/range axioms added where a property serves different CQs. Individuals are typed to their respective classes. Axioms materialize proposed constraints and Themis test requirements.</vaem:rationale>
</prov:Activity>

